{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20493","headline":"送郑尚书出镇南海 · 张籍","name":"送郑尚书出镇南海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远镇承新命，王程不假催。\n班行争路送，恩赐并时来。\n牙斾从城展，兵符到府开。\n蛮声喧夜市，海色浸潮台。\n画角天边月，寒关岭上梅。\n共知公望重，多是隔年回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}